# Release build tools: freeze the GUI sidecar (architecture §10). Not needed for development or
# pull-request CI. Compiled with hashes into requirements-build.lock:
#   uv pip compile requirements-build.in --universal --python-version 3.12 --generate-hashes -o requirements-build.lock
# Runtime pins come from requirements.lock (constraint), so the frozen sidecar matches it.
-c requirements.lock

